{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e922abc722bf6913","type":"text","text":"# 各模块依赖关系 \n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    %% ========== 可执行文件层 ==========\n    WmsApp[\"🖥️ WmsApp (main.cpp)\"]\n\n    %% ========== 应用层 ==========\n    subgraph 应用层[\"📱 应用层 (application)\"]\n        direction TB\n        WmsApplication[\"WmsApplication (聚合库)\"]\n        WmsAuthServices[\"WmsAuthServices (静态库)\"]\n    end\n\n    %% ========== 基础设施层 ==========\n    subgraph 基础设施层[\"⚙️ 基础设施层 (infrastructure)\"]\n        direction TB\n        WmsCore[\"WmsCore (聚合库)\"]\n        WmsDatabase[\"WmsDatabase (静态库)\"]\n        WmsConfigManager[\"WmsConfigManager (静态库)\"]\n        WmsSecurity[\"WmsSecurity (静态库)\"]\n    end\n\n    %% ========== 领域层 ==========\n    subgraph 领域层[\"📦 领域层 (domain)\"]\n        direction TB\n        WmsDomain[\"WmsDomain (聚合库)\"]\n        WmsAuthDomain[\"WmsAuthDomain (接口库)\"]\n    end\n\n    %% ========== 外部依赖 ==========\n    subgraph 外部依赖[\"🔗 外部依赖\"]\n        direction TB\n        Qt6Core[\"Qt6::Core\"]\n        Qt6Sql[\"Qt6::Sql\"]\n        Qt6Network[\"Qt6::Network\"]\n    end\n\n    %% ========== 树形连线 ==========\n    WmsApp --> WmsApplication\n    WmsApp --> WmsCore\n\n    WmsApplication --> WmsAuthServices\n    WmsAuthServices --> WmsCore\n    WmsAuthServices --> WmsDomain\n    WmsAuthServices --> WmsSecurity\n\n    WmsCore --> WmsDatabase\n    WmsCore --> WmsConfigManager\n    WmsCore --> WmsSecurity\n\n    WmsConfigManager -.->|PUBLIC| WmsDatabase\n    WmsSecurity -.->|PUBLIC| WmsDomain\n\n    WmsDomain --> WmsAuthDomain\n\n    WmsDatabase --> Qt6Core\n    WmsDatabase --> Qt6Sql\n    WmsConfigManager --> Qt6Core\n    WmsSecurity --> Qt6Core\n    WmsSecurity --> Qt6Network\n    WmsAuthDomain --> Qt6Core\n\n    %% ========== 样式 ==========\n    classDef exec fill:#e74c3c,stroke:#c0392b,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef app fill:#3498db,stroke:#2980b9,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef infra fill:#27ae60,stroke:#1e8449,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef domain fill:#8e44ad,stroke:#6c3483,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef external fill:#7f8c8d,stroke:#5d6d7e,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px\n\n    class WmsApp exec\n    class WmsApplication,WmsAuthServices app\n    class WmsCore,WmsDatabase,WmsConfigManager,WmsSecurity infra\n    class WmsDomain,WmsAuthDomain domain\n    class Qt6Core,Qt6Sql,Qt6Network external\n```\n\n## 依赖传递路径\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph 可执行文件[\"🖥️ 可执行文件\"]\n        direction TB\n        WmsApp[\"WmsApp\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 应用层[\"📱 应用层\"]\n        direction TB\n        WmsApplication[\"WmsApplication\"]\n        WmsAuthServices[\"WmsAuthServices\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 基础设施层[\"⚙️ 基础设施层\"]\n        direction TB\n        WmsCore[\"WmsCore\"]\n        WmsDatabase[\"WmsDatabase\"]\n        WmsConfigManager[\"WmsConfigManager\"]\n        WmsSecurity[\"WmsSecurity\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 领域层[\"📦 领域层\"]\n        direction TB\n        WmsDomain[\"WmsDomain\"]\n        WmsAuthDomain[\"WmsAuthDomain\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 外部依赖[\"🔗 外部依赖\"]\n        direction TB\n        Qt6_Core[\"Qt6::Core\"]\n        Qt6_Sql[\"Qt6::Sql\"]\n        Qt6_Network[\"Qt6::Network\"]\n    end\n\n    WmsApp --> WmsApplication\n    WmsApp --> WmsCore\n\n    WmsApplication --> WmsAuthServices\n    WmsAuthServices --> WmsCore\n    WmsAuthServices --> WmsDomain\n    WmsAuthServices --> WmsSecurity\n\n    WmsCore --> WmsDatabase\n    WmsCore --> WmsConfigManager\n    WmsCore --> WmsSecurity\n\n    WmsConfigManager -.-> WmsDatabase\n    WmsSecurity -.-> WmsDomain\n\n    WmsDomain --> WmsAuthDomain\n\n    WmsDatabase --> Qt6_Core\n    WmsDatabase --> Qt6_Sql\n    WmsConfigManager --> Qt6_Core\n    WmsSecurity --> Qt6_Core\n    WmsSecurity --> Qt6_Network\n    WmsAuthDomain --> Qt6_Core\n\n    classDef exec fill:#e74c3c,stroke:#c0392b,color:#fff\n    classDef app fill:#3498db,stroke:#2980b9,color:#fff\n    classDef infra fill:#27ae60,stroke:#1e8449,color:#fff\n    classDef domain fill:#8e44ad,stroke:#6c3483,color:#fff\n    classDef external fill:#7f8c8d,stroke:#5d6d7e,color:#fff\n\n    class WmsApp exec\n    class WmsApplication,WmsAuthServices app\n    class WmsCore,WmsDatabase,WmsConfigManager,WmsSecurity infra\n    class WmsDomain,WmsAuthDomain domain\n    class Qt6_Core,Qt6_Sql,Qt6_Network external\n```\n","x":-1600,"y":40,"width":1340,"height":2340}
